<step1>
<ptxt>JEITA Standard Error Codes</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>When a JEITA standard error code occurs, it is notified by an interrupt display on the multi-display.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>JEITA Standard Error Codes</title>
<tgroup cols="4">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.71in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.42in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.48in"/>
<colspec colname="COL4" colwidth="2.47in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnostic Trouble Code (DTC)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Item</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Possible Cause</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Countermeasure</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>01</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ETC Card Insertion Error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>ETC card not inserted during communication</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>ETC card improperly inserted</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Check the insertion of the ETC card and insert it again</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Communication other than ETC, such as with a parking lot system, was performed without an ETC card inserted</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Ask the customer whether a parking lot system etc. using ETC was used</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>02</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Data Processing Error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Error reading from or writing to ETC card</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Poor contact between ETC card and ETC on-board unit</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Momentary interruption while accessing ETC card</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Card removed during writing</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>An IC card other than an ETC card is inserted</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If an ETC card was inserted, insert it again; if the same error code is output, inspect the ETC on-board unit</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the vehicle is directed (displayed) to stop at the toll gate, stop the vehicle and follow the attendant's instructions</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>03</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ETC Card Error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>ETC card is faulty</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>A card other than an IC card is inserted and does not communicate</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>ETC card inserted incorrectly (upside down, wrong insertion direction)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Check that the ETC card is correct and the insertion direction etc., and insert it again; if the same error code is output, contact the ETC card issuer</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>04</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>On-board unit malfunction</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>The ETC on-board unit is judged to be faulty based on the self-diagnosis result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Start the engine again; if the same error code is output, inspect the ETC on-board unit</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry morerows="2" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>05</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="2" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ETC card information abnormal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>ETC card authentication error</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>An IC card other than an ETC card is inserted</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>ETC card removed during authentication</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>ETC card inserted into ETC on-board unit that has not been set up</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Check that the ETC card is correct and the insertion direction etc., and insert it again; if the same error code is output, inspect the ETC on-board unit</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Setup card was reinserted</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Check whether the on-board unit has been set up</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A setup card with a different on-board unit management number was inserted</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Check that the on-board unit management number is correct using the 3 items: setup card, setup application form and ETC on-board unit part number label</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>06</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>On-board unit information abnormal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Authentication error with roadside antenna</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>An error occurred in data processing between the on-board unit and the toll gate, so follow the toll gate attendant's instructions</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>07</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Communication Error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Communication with roadside antenna ended prematurely</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>An error occurred in data processing between the on-board unit and the toll gate, so follow the toll gate attendant's instructions</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Ask the customer whether a parking lot system etc. using ETC was used</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</step1>
<step1>
<ptxt>ETC System Error Codes (Diagnosis Mode 1)</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>This DTC is announced by voice from the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>ETC System Error Codes (Diagnosis Mode 1)</title>
<tgroup cols="4">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.54in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.09in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.12in"/>
<colspec colname="COL4" colwidth="3.33in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnostic Trouble Code (DTC)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Item</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Possible Cause</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Action if Recurring</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>11</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Self-diagnosis error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Internal malfunction of the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly, such as the security IC or memory</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>If it recurs, replace and set up the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Fatal Error)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>12</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Self-diagnosis error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Internal malfunction of the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly, such as the security IC or memory</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>If it recurs, replace and set up the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Fatal Error)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>41</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ETC card write error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Writing data to the ETC card has failed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Check the ETC card for abnormalities</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>In other cases, contact the card company; if it recurs, replace and set up the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>42</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DSRC authentication error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A security-related malfunction has occurred during road-to-vehicle communication</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Investigate the toll gate where it occurred; if it recurs, replace and set up the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>43</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Road-to-vehicle communication error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>An error (other than an authentication error) has occurred during road-to-vehicle communication</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Investigate the toll gate where it occurred</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>44</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Communication with no card inserted</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Road-to-vehicle communication has occurred with no card inserted</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Explain to the customer</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>45</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Passage not permitted error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>"Passage not permitted" has been notified from the roadside antenna with a card inserted</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Investigate the toll gate where it occurred</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Explain to the customer (check whether the ETC card has expired)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>46</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Passage not permitted error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>"Passage not permitted" has been notified from the roadside antenna because ETC card authentication was not completed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Investigate the toll gate where it occurred</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Explain to the customer (check whether the card was inserted just before the ETC gate)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>47</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Passage not permitted error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>"Passage not permitted" has been notified from the roadside antenna because a card read error occurred</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Investigate the toll gate where it occurred</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Explain to the customer</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>48</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Communication incomplete error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Communication with the roadside antenna was lost (timeout)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Investigate the toll gate where it occurred</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Check that there are no objects blocking radio waves around the instrument panel</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>49</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Communication incomplete error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Communication with the roadside antenna was cut off midway (release received)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Investigate the toll gate where it occurred</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>51</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Charge information malfunction</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Charge amount abnormal at toll gate settlement</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Investigate the toll gate where it occurred</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>52</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Charge information malfunction</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Charge unit abnormal at toll gate settlement</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Investigate the toll gate where it occurred</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>61</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>RF module malfunction</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>The frequency could not be locked by the frequency switching function at some time</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Toll collection (ETC) computer assembly malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>If it recurs, replace and set up the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>62</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Antenna malfunction (history)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>The ETC antenna has been disconnected or the ETC antenna cable has had an open circuit</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Check the navigation antenna assembly connection</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Inspect the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly as a single unit</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>After clearing the DTC, check the symptom again; if the same code is detected again, replace the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>71</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Card read error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Reading data from the ETC card has failed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If none of several ETC cards are authenticated, replace and set up the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If some ETC cards are not authenticated, contact the card company</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>72</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Card authentication error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Authentication with the ETC card has failed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If none of several ETC cards are authenticated, replace and set up the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If some ETC cards are not authenticated, contact the card company</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>73</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Card error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No response from the ETC card</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If none of several ETC cards are authenticated, replace and set up the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If some ETC cards are not authenticated, contact the card company</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>74</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Card removal error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>The ETC card has been removed while it was being read</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Explain to the customer</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>75</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Card removal error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>The ETC card has been removed while data was being written to it</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Explain to the customer</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>76</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Wrong card insertion error</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>The ETC card has been inserted incorrectly (upside down, wrong insertion direction)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>A card other than an IC card has been inserted</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>A faulty ETC card has been inserted</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Toll collection (ETC) computer assembly malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Explain to the customer</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>77</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
